{"id":2276,"date":"2024-09-19T12:33:00","date_gmt":"2024-09-19T12:33:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/?post_type=product&#038;p=2276"},"modified":"2025-10-02T10:46:43","modified_gmt":"2025-10-02T10:46:43","slug":"cardboard-gable-boxes","status":"publish","type":"product","link":"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/cardboard-gable-boxes\/","title":{"rendered":"Cardboard Gable Boxes"},"content":{"rendered":"<h2 data-start=\"54\" data-end=\"430\">Perfect for Takeout, Bakery Goods, and Event Giveaways<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"54\" data-end=\"430\">We at <a href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/\"><em data-start=\"60\" data-end=\"82\">Shop Cardboard Boxes<\/em><\/a> offer durable and lightweight <strong data-start=\"113\" data-end=\"138\">cardboard gable boxes<\/strong> designed for packaging products with both protection and presentation in mind. These boxes are an excellent choice for takeout, bakery goods, event giveaways, and retail items. Their built-in handle and secure tuck closure make them highly efficient for hand-carrying or on-the-go packaging.<\/p>\n<h2 data-start=\"703\" data-end=\"754\">Sturdy and Presentable Cardboard Gable Packaging<\/h2>\n<h3 data-start=\"756\" data-end=\"804\">A Go-To Solution for Takeaway and Retail Use<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"806\" data-end=\"1059\">Our <strong data-start=\"810\" data-end=\"844\">cardboard gable boxes for sale<\/strong> are widely used in food service, gift packaging, cosmetics, and promotional campaigns. These boxes offer quick assembly and a clean design, helping businesses maintain fast operations without compromising on style.<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"1061\" data-end=\"1284\">\n<li data-start=\"1061\" data-end=\"1112\">\n<p data-start=\"1063\" data-end=\"1112\">Easy to assemble with auto-lock or tuck closure<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1113\" data-end=\"1163\">\n<p data-start=\"1115\" data-end=\"1163\">Ideal for retail display or takeaway packaging<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1164\" data-end=\"1232\">\n<p data-start=\"1166\" data-end=\"1232\">Suitable for dry food, clothing accessories, cosmetics, and more<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1233\" data-end=\"1284\">\n<p data-start=\"1235\" data-end=\"1284\">Can be flat-packed to save space during storage<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"1286\" data-end=\"1405\">With strong foldable handles, they support both presentation and convenience, especially in quick-service environments.<\/p>\n<h3 data-start=\"1407\" data-end=\"1443\">Built to Handle Weight with Care<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"1445\" data-end=\"1595\">We also manufacture <strong data-start=\"1465\" data-end=\"1491\">heavy duty gable boxes<\/strong> using double-wall corrugated material. These are perfect when the product weight requires more support.<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"1597\" data-end=\"1739\">\n<li data-start=\"1597\" data-end=\"1633\">\n<p data-start=\"1599\" data-end=\"1633\">Reinforced bottom and side walls<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1634\" data-end=\"1681\">\n<p data-start=\"1636\" data-end=\"1681\">Additional locking flaps for secure closure<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1682\" data-end=\"1739\">\n<p data-start=\"1684\" data-end=\"1739\">Support heavier food items, jars, or glass containers<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"1741\" data-end=\"1846\">They are well-suited for events, meal kits, catering boxes, and gift deliveries that need extra strength.<\/p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><strong>Feature<\/strong><\/th>\n<th><strong>Description<\/strong><\/th>\n<th><strong>Material Options<\/strong><\/th>\n<th><strong>Finishing Choices<\/strong><\/th>\n<th><strong>Add-ons &amp; Features<\/strong><\/th>\n<th><strong>Usage\/Application<\/strong><\/th>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Sizes<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>Fully Custom Sizes (Small to Extra-Large)<\/td>\n<td>Corrugated Board, White SBS, Kraft Paperboard<\/td>\n<td>Gloss, Matte, Spot UV<\/td>\n<td>Inserts, Locking Tabs, Folded Flaps<\/td>\n<td>Retail packaging, Food boxes, Gift packaging<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Materials<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>Corrugated, White SBS, Kraft<\/td>\n<td>10pt\u201328pt (60lb\u2013400lb) thickness<\/td>\n<td>Anti-Scratch, Soft Touch, Matte Lamination<\/td>\n<td>Eco-friendly inks, Food-safe coating<\/td>\n<td>Electronics, Apparel, Cosmetics<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Coating Options<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>Gloss, Matte, Spot UV<\/td>\n<td>FDA-safe Laminate, Eco Kraft Laminate<\/td>\n<td>Soft Touch, Aqueous Coating<\/td>\n<td>Moisture Resistance, Tear Resistance<\/td>\n<td>Takeout food, Subscription boxes<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Printing Types<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>CMYK, PMS, Foil, One-Color or Full-Color<\/td>\n<td>Digital &amp; Offset Printing<\/td>\n<td>Embossing, Debossing, Foil Stamping<\/td>\n<td>QR Codes, Barcodes, Logo Branding<\/td>\n<td>Promotional kits, Corporate gifts<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Styles<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>Gable with Handle, Gable with Window, Gable with Locking Flap<\/td>\n<td>White Cardboard, Kraft, E-Flute<\/td>\n<td>Matte or Gloss Finish<\/td>\n<td>Die-cuts, Clear PVC Film<\/td>\n<td>Bakery items, Party favors, Food delivery<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Add-Ons<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>Die-Cut Windows, Clear PVC Film, Inserts, Ribbons<\/td>\n<td>FSC-Certified Board<\/td>\n<td>Metallic Foiling, Spot UV<\/td>\n<td>Ribbon Handles, Divider Inserts<\/td>\n<td>Confectionery, Apparel, Retail gifts<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Food Safe<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>FDA-Compliant Options Available<\/td>\n<td>Food-Grade Kraft, SBS, Recycled Board<\/td>\n<td>Food-Safe Lamination<\/td>\n<td>Heat-Sealed Lining<\/td>\n<td>Bakery, Takeaway food, Frozen goods<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>MOQ<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>100 Units and Up<\/td>\n<td>Flexible Bulk Options<\/td>\n<td>Tiered Pricing<\/td>\n<td>Auto-Restocking<\/td>\n<td>Small businesses &amp; Large retailers<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Turnaround Time<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>4\u20136 Business Days, Rush Available<\/td>\n<td>Priority Board Stocks<\/td>\n<td>Fast Press Coating<\/td>\n<td>Express Shipping Upgrade<\/td>\n<td>Urgent deliveries, Seasonal sales<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Proof Options<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>3D Mockup, Flat View, Sample (On Request)<\/td>\n<td>Digital &amp; Physical Proof<\/td>\n<td>Gloss\/Matte Sample Finish<\/td>\n<td>Test Run on Request<\/td>\n<td>Branding checks, Design approval<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Shipping<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>Free Nationwide Delivery<\/td>\n<td>Custom Packaging for Transit<\/td>\n<td>Moisture Barrier Finish<\/td>\n<td>Protective Inserts<\/td>\n<td>E-commerce, Wholesale distribution<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Design Support<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>Free Design Assistance and File Setup<\/td>\n<td>AI, PDF, PSD File Acceptance<\/td>\n<td>Matte\/Gloss Sample Finish<\/td>\n<td>File Corrections, Layout Adjustments<\/td>\n<td>Startups, Branding projects<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<hr data-start=\"3386\" data-end=\"3389\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"3391\" data-end=\"3444\">Cardboard Boxes With Window for Product Visibility<\/h2>\n<h3 data-start=\"3446\" data-end=\"3495\">Showcase Your Product Without Opening the Box<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"3497\" data-end=\"3749\">If your packaging needs to display the product inside, our <strong data-start=\"3556\" data-end=\"3587\">c<\/strong>ardboard boxes with window options can help you make a stronger impression. The window can be die-cut in any shape\u2014round, oval, square, or custom\u2014and fitted with clear film for protection.<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"3751\" data-end=\"3950\">\n<li data-start=\"3751\" data-end=\"3806\">\n<p data-start=\"3753\" data-end=\"3806\">Popular for cupcakes, gift sets, and retail samples<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"3807\" data-end=\"3838\">\n<p data-start=\"3809\" data-end=\"3838\">Helps increase shelf appeal<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"3839\" data-end=\"3909\">\n<p data-start=\"3841\" data-end=\"3909\">Keeps contents visible while staying protected from dust or damage<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"3910\" data-end=\"3950\">\n<p data-start=\"3912\" data-end=\"3950\">Available with or without film cover<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"3952\" data-end=\"4064\">This makes your packaging more interactive while reducing the need to open or touch the product before purchase.<\/p>\n<h3 data-start=\"4066\" data-end=\"4112\">Excellent Choice for Food and Retail Goods<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"4114\" data-end=\"4284\">Window gable boxes are commonly used in bakeries, delis, or for holiday gift bundles. They can be decorated with seasonal artwork, product branding, or ingredient panels.<\/p>\n<h3 data-start=\"97\" data-end=\"138\">Cardboard Boxes with Window Options<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"140\" data-end=\"477\">If you&#8217;re looking for <a href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/cardboard-boxes-with-window\/\"><strong data-start=\"162\" data-end=\"264\">cardboard boxes with window<\/strong><\/a> options to showcase your product inside while keeping it protected, we also offer die-cut window panels with optional clear film covers. All boxes can be custom printed and cut to your specific size and layout.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"4286\" data-end=\"4289\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"4291\" data-end=\"4344\">Why Choose Cardboard Gable Boxes for Your Business<\/h2>\n<h3 data-start=\"4346\" data-end=\"4372\">Bulk Ordering Benefits<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"4374\" data-end=\"4595\">Ordering <strong data-start=\"4383\" data-end=\"4417\">cardboard gable boxes for sale<\/strong> in bulk ensures that your packaging supply is always ready and affordable. Whether you\u2019re running a local caf\u00e9 or managing corporate event packaging, we can scale to your needs.<\/p>\n<ol data-start=\"4597\" data-end=\"4798\">\n<li data-start=\"4597\" data-end=\"4642\">\n<p data-start=\"4600\" data-end=\"4642\">Reduced cost per box with higher volumes<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"4643\" data-end=\"4699\">\n<p data-start=\"4646\" data-end=\"4699\">Faster reorders with existing die-lines and artwork<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"4700\" data-end=\"4744\">\n<p data-start=\"4703\" data-end=\"4744\">Inventory stability during peak seasons<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"4745\" data-end=\"4798\">\n<p data-start=\"4748\" data-end=\"4798\">Custom box sizes and prints at wholesale pricing<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p data-start=\"4800\" data-end=\"4888\">Our boxes are easy to store, quick to assemble, and highly adaptable to a range of uses.<\/p>\n<h3 data-start=\"4890\" data-end=\"4923\">Made for Various Applications<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"4925\" data-end=\"5103\">Whether you\u2019re sending a small item in a <strong data-start=\"4966\" data-end=\"4996\">single cardboard gable box<\/strong> or packaging a meal kit in a <strong data-start=\"5026\" data-end=\"5050\">heavy duty gable box<\/strong>, our team can guide you through the right selection.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"5105\" data-end=\"5108\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"5110\" data-end=\"5163\">Finishing and Printing Options for Custom Branding<\/h2>\n<h3 data-start=\"5165\" data-end=\"5209\">Coating for Surface Protection and Shine<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"5211\" data-end=\"5301\">Add a professional look with finishing options that increase durability and visual appeal.<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"5303\" data-end=\"5446\">\n<li data-start=\"5303\" data-end=\"5352\">\n<p data-start=\"5305\" data-end=\"5352\">Gloss coating for bold, eye-catching surfaces<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"5353\" data-end=\"5402\">\n<p data-start=\"5355\" data-end=\"5402\">Matte finish for a smooth and refined texture<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"5403\" data-end=\"5446\">\n<p data-start=\"5405\" data-end=\"5446\">Spot UV for selective logo highlighting<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"5448\" data-end=\"5573\">Our coatings resist fingerprints, smudges, and minor scratches, which keeps the box looking clean during transit or handling.<\/p>\n<h3 data-start=\"5575\" data-end=\"5611\">Printing That Matches Your Brand<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"5613\" data-end=\"5713\">We support everything from simple one-color prints to full-top CMYK prints with photographic detail.<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"5715\" data-end=\"5819\">\n<li data-start=\"5715\" data-end=\"5743\">\n<p data-start=\"5717\" data-end=\"5743\">Brand logos and taglines<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"5744\" data-end=\"5772\">\n<p data-start=\"5746\" data-end=\"5772\">Instructions or QR codes<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"5773\" data-end=\"5819\">\n<p data-start=\"5775\" data-end=\"5819\">Promotional artwork for seasonal campaigns<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"5821\" data-end=\"5919\">Design help is included for every order, and mock-ups are provided for approval before production.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"5921\" data-end=\"5924\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"5926\" data-end=\"5963\">How to Get Started with Your Order<\/h2>\n<h3 data-start=\"5965\" data-end=\"6002\">Simple Steps for Custom Packaging<\/h3>\n<ol data-start=\"6004\" data-end=\"6269\">\n<li data-start=\"6004\" data-end=\"6040\">\n<p data-start=\"6007\" data-end=\"6040\">Choose your box size and layout<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"6041\" data-end=\"6085\">\n<p data-start=\"6044\" data-end=\"6085\">Select printing and coating preferences<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"6086\" data-end=\"6139\">\n<p data-start=\"6089\" data-end=\"6139\">Share your artwork or request help from our team<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"6140\" data-end=\"6181\">\n<p data-start=\"6143\" data-end=\"6181\">Review your 3D mock-up or flat proof<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"6182\" data-end=\"6215\">\n<p data-start=\"6185\" data-end=\"6215\">Approve and place your order<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"6216\" data-end=\"6269\">\n<p data-start=\"6219\" data-end=\"6269\">Receive your boxes with free nationwide shipping<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p data-start=\"6271\" data-end=\"6370\">Production is fast and streamlined, and our support team is always available if you have questions.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"6372\" data-end=\"6375\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"6377\" data-end=\"6406\">More Products You May Like<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"6408\" data-end=\"6603\">Our <strong data-start=\"129\" data-end=\"161\">F<\/strong>ood-Related Cardboard Boxes are commonly used in foodservice, catering, and event packaging. For additional packaging formats across different needs, you can view the <a class=\"\" href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product-category\/cardboard-boxes-for-specific-uses\/\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"301\" data-end=\"424\"><strong data-start=\"302\" data-end=\"339\">Cardboard Boxes For Specific Uses<\/strong><\/a> section of our site.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"6787\" data-end=\"6790\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"6792\" data-end=\"6839\">Why Shop Cardboard Boxes Is the Right Choice<\/h2>\n<ul data-start=\"6841\" data-end=\"7197\">\n<li data-start=\"6841\" data-end=\"6887\">\n<p data-start=\"6843\" data-end=\"6887\">Wholesale pricing on cardboard gable boxes<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"6888\" data-end=\"6926\">\n<p data-start=\"6890\" data-end=\"6926\">Free shipping on all custom orders<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"6927\" data-end=\"6975\">\n<p data-start=\"6929\" data-end=\"6975\">Gloss, Matte, and Spot UV finishes available<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"6976\" data-end=\"7017\">\n<p data-start=\"6978\" data-end=\"7017\">Free design support and artwork setup<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"7018\" data-end=\"7054\">\n<p data-start=\"7020\" data-end=\"7054\">Custom window and handle options<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"7055\" data-end=\"7097\">\n<p data-start=\"7057\" data-end=\"7097\">Boxes available plain or fully printed<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"7098\" data-end=\"7151\">\n<p data-start=\"7100\" data-end=\"7151\">Strong materials including heavy duty gable boxes<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"7152\" data-end=\"7197\">\n<p data-start=\"7154\" data-end=\"7197\">Fast production and rush delivery options<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Our Cardboard Gable Boxes offer an excellent packaging solution, combining durability and convenience with a unique, easy-to-carry design. Made from high-quality cardboard, they feature a unique gable top that adds a touch of elegance. Customize the size, shape, and design to perfectly suit your brand.We offer free design services and fast turnaround times to ensure your packaging is ready when you need it. Order now.<\/p>\n<div class=\"container\"><\/div>\n","protected":false},"featured_media":2410,"template":"","meta":{"_joinchat":[]},"product_brand":[],"product_cat":[182],"product_tag":[],"class_list":["post-2276","product","type-product","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","product_cat-cardboard-boxes-for-specific-uses","rishi-post","first","instock","shipping-taxable","purchasable","product-type-simple"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v27.9 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>Buy Cardboard Gable Boxes | Shop Cardboard Boxes<\/title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Premium cardboard gable boxes for elegant product packaging. Customize size, design, and finish. Fast turnaround, free design, and shipping.\" \/>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/cardboard-gable-boxes\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Buy Cardboard Gable Boxes | Shop Cardboard Boxes\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Premium cardboard gable boxes for elegant product packaging. Customize size, design, and finish. Fast turnaround, free design, and shipping.\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/cardboard-gable-